    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a puzzle I enjoy solving, but it’s not my strongest subject. I find it creative when applied to computer science or art projects. It’s practical for coding, but I’d rather dive into algorithms than complex proofs. I’m still learning to appreciate its elegance without getting overwhelmed.",
